            PSI-MS accession string. @return <code>YES</code>
            iff `acc` is `@"MS:1000129"`.
          </desc>
        </method>
        <method type="BOOL" factory="yes">
          <sel>isNucleusAccession:</sel>
          <arg type="NSString*">acc</arg>
          <desc>
            Whether the given accession identifies an NMR
